[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot 328 - Fog Bank stops only combat damage
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Grizzly Bears and have Shock in hand with one red mana floating. The opponent is at 2 life and controls an untapped Fog Bank (0/2 flying defender; prevent all combat damage dealt to and dealt by it). Destroy Fog Bank and reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-fog-bank-noncombat | A prevention effect applies only to the damage it describes (CR 615.1): Fog Bank prevents combat damage, not Shock's, so Shock the Fog Bank first and the Bears' 2 damage is unblocked; Shock to the face leaves Fog Bank to block and absorb the Bears
